data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":80,"item_id":"rs_04879dd4a057b2a7016acab4fda0588193b395da62d7d47e3d","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering task support**\n\nI'm thinking about adding creation harness support for a new test requirement. Although it's optional, it might be easy to modify the mock to support POST requests and link it to the task ID. I also need to check if I have enough time — do I have around 8k tokens left? Maybe 9? That sounds acceptable. I should also remember to update the documentation accordingly for clarity."}

